# WhatsApp Business API Integration Guidelines

You are a WhatsApp API expert who ensures proper implementation of messaging functionality for the Wispen financial assistant, following clean architecture principles.

## Connection and Setup

- Implement secure connection to WhatsApp Business API using environment variables
- Configure proper webhook verification and challenge response
- Handle connection status and reconnection logic
- Implement proper logging for connection events
- Set up appropriate error handling for connection issues
- Configure proper message queuing for high reliability

## Message Reception

- Implement handlers for all WhatsApp message types
- Properly identify and extract user information from incoming messages
- Validate webhook signatures for security
- Implement rate limiting to prevent abuse
- Handle message ordering and potential duplicates
- Properly acknowledge message receipt

## Message Format Handling

### Text Messages
- Properly parse and sanitize incoming text
- Handle special characters and encoding issues
- Extract commands and parameters from text messages
- Process multilingual text appropriately
- Handle message formatting (bold, italic, etc.)

### Audio Messages
- Extract and validate audio file formats (opus, mp3, etc.)
- Implement proper audio file storage in Supabase
- Configure audio processing pipeline with GPT-4o
- Handle audio length limitations
- Implement proper error handling for failed audio processing

### Image Messages
- Extract and validate image formats (jpeg, png, etc.)
- Implement image preprocessing for OCR optimization
- Configure storage for receipt images in Supabase
- Handle image resolution and size limitations
- Process image metadata when available

### Document Messages
- Handle PDF and other document formats
- Implement document validation and virus scanning
- Configure processing pipeline for document extraction
- Store documents securely with proper access control

### Location Messages
- Extract location data from WhatsApp location messages
- Validate coordinates and location information
- Associate location data with transactions when relevant
- Handle location privacy concerns appropriately

### Contact Messages
- Process WhatsApp shared contacts when relevant
- Validate contact information for security
- Handle contact information with privacy considerations

### Interactive Messages
- Process button responses from interactive messages
- Handle list selections properly
- Track interaction state for multi-step processes
- Implement proper timeout handling for interactive elements

## Message Response Construction

- Structure responses according to WhatsApp API requirements
- Implement proper formatting for text responses
- Create well-structured interactive messages with buttons and lists
- Generate and send media responses (images, documents)
- Include appropriate templates for common scenarios
- Implement proper delay handling for natural conversation flow

## WhatsApp Templates

- Create and manage message templates for notifications
- Follow WhatsApp approval guidelines for templates
- Implement proper template variables and formatting
- Track template performance and delivery status
- Handle template rejection gracefully
- Test templates across different device types

## User Session Management

- Implement proper user identification and session tracking
- Handle conversation context across multiple messages
- Implement session timeouts and expiration logic
- Store contextual information for ongoing conversations
- Handle multi-device scenarios properly

## Error Handling

- Implement proper error handling for all WhatsApp API responses
- Handle rate limiting errors with exponential backoff
- Provide user-friendly error messages for WhatsApp-related issues
- Log detailed error information for troubleshooting
- Implement retry logic for transient errors
- Handle disconnections and reconnections gracefully

